{
  "tema": 6981,
  "slug": "el-mismo-la-misma",
  "titulo": "El mismo, la misma = the same",
  "subtitulo": "Vivimos en la misma colonia.",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "The same is el mismo, la misma, los mismos, las mismas + noun, agreeing with the noun; the same as is el mismo... que. The same thing in general is lo mismo.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**The same** = definite article + **mismo**, and both agree with the noun."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "el / la / los / las",
            "+ mismo/a/os/as +",
            "noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Form",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "el mismo",
              "el mismo carro"
            ],
            [
              "la misma",
              "la misma playa"
            ],
            [
              "los mismos",
              "los mismos amigos"
            ],
            [
              "las mismas",
              "las mismas olas"
            ],
            [
              "lo mismo",
              "the same thing (no noun)"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Without a noun, it works as a pronoun: **Es la misma.** = _It's the same one._"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "_The same as_ = **el mismo... que**: **tengo la misma tabla que tú**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "For _the same thing_ in general, use neuter **lo mismo**: **siempre pido lo mismo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**A + el mismo = al mismo**: **al mismo tiempo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **mismo** is a mirror. It copies the article's gender and number."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Vivimos en ==la misma== colonia.",
              "en": "We live in the same neighborhood."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tenemos ==el mismo== maestro de jiu-jitsu.",
              "en": "We have the same jiu-jitsu teacher."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi hermano y yo tenemos ==los mismos== ojos.",
              "en": "My brother and I have the same eyes."
            },
            {
              "es": "Usas ==las mismas== quillas que yo.",
              "en": "You use the same fins as me."
            },
            {
              "es": "Llegaron ==al mismo== tiempo.",
              "en": "They arrived at the same time."
            },
            {
              "es": "Esa es ==la misma== playa de la foto.",
              "en": "That's the same beach as in the photo."
            },
            {
              "es": "Siempre pido ==lo mismo==: tacos de adobada.",
              "en": "I always order the same thing: adobada tacos."
            },
            {
              "es": "No es ==lo mismo== surfear en invierno que en verano.",
              "en": "Surfing in winter isn't the same as in summer."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
